    thuc_te:     { value: "⭐ DUONG CONG USD LIEN NGAN HANG 10/11: O/N 3,84 · 1T 3,91 · 2T 3,93 · 1M 4,08", updated: "13/11/2026", source: "[PRIMARY] nguoiquansat ban phien, so ngay 10/11 — DU CA HAI DUONG CONG cung phien", note: "USD 10/11: O/N 3,84 · 1T 3,91 · 2T 3,93 · 1M 4,08 — gan nhu DI NGANG so 03/11 (3,85/3,90/3,93/4,04), chi 1M nhich 4bp. Duong cong USD PHANG, chenh O/N-1M chi 0,24dpt · VND 10/11: 4,40 / 4,80 / 5,10 / 5,40 — do doc 1,00dpt · ⭐ O MOI KY HAN VND DEU DAT HON USD, khac voi 03/11 khi O/N con AM 0,15dpt. Gap duong tren toan duong cong · ⭐ NGUON: ban phien hang ngay cua nguoiquansat co ca hai duong cong — dung nguon nay, khong dung bao cao tuan (bao cao tuan khong cong bo chan USD)" },
    du_bao_irp:  { value: "IRP CAP NHAT 14/10 — Fed funds mid 3,875% (DA TANG, khong con gia dinh): v1 dung NHNN avg 6,01%: forward 1 nam uoc ~26.650 → risk premium ~550d so spot 26.100 · v2 dung TT2 1M 4,83% (so thuc dung trong Gap CCS): forward ngu y chi ~26.350 → risk premium ~250d · v3 dung LS thoa thuan thuc 9,0-9,6%: forward ~27.450-27.600 → premium AM (forward CAO HON du bao ty gia)", updated: "14/10/2026", source: "[DERIVED] Tinh lai 14/10 tu TT2 1M + Fed funds thuc", note: "⚠️ SUA GIA DINH LAC HAU 79 NGAY: ban cu con gia dinh 'Fed T9 hike prob 82,4%' — Fed DA TANG THAT 16/9 len 3,75-4,00% · ⭐ BA PHIEN BAN LECH NHAU RAT XA (26.350 / 26.650 / 27.450) vi mau so LS VND khac nhau 4,8 den 9,6%. KET LUAN PHUONG PHAP: IRP chi dung duoc khi chon dung LS tham chieu — voi muc dich do ap luc ty gia, dung TT2 1M (v2) vi do la LS co the arbitrage thuc; v3 khong arbitrage duoc vi LS thoa thuan khong co thi truong ky han doi ung" },
