    cpi_impact:   { value: "THUC TE T9/2026: CPI 5,08% YoY (+0,62% MoM), BQ 9T 4,52% — nhom giao thong +11,67%, cao nhat trong 11 nhom hang · Co che truyen dan xac nhan: xang E10 tu 24.239d (10/9) len 28.254d (8/10) = +16,6% trong 4 tuan", updated: "14/10/2026", source: "[OFFICIAL] Cuc Thong ke T9 + Lien Bo ky 8/10", note: "⚠️ SUA SO LAC HAU 50 NGAY: ban cu ghi 'CPI T7/2026 = 4,45%' va doi chieu voi Brent 88,24 (25/8) · ⭐ CHUOI TRUYEN DAN DAY DU DA CHUNG MINH: Brent 104-108 → MOPS tang → xang +16,6%/4 tuan → giao thong +11,67% → CPI headline vuot 5% · Ky 15/10 du bao GIAM 600-1.200d/lit la cua ha nhiet dau tien cho CPI T10" },
